# 7. PSEUDOCODE

BEGIN

```
DECLARE vehicle records

LOAD records from file

REPEAT

    DISPLAY main menu

    READ user choice

    SWITCH choice

        CASE 1:
            Add new customer and vehicle record

        CASE 2:
            Display all records

        CASE 3:
            Search record using registration number

        CASE 4:
            Modify existing record

        CASE 5:
            Delete existing record

        CASE 6:
            Calculate total service expenses

        CASE 7:
            Display maintenance reminders

        CASE 8:
            Save records to file

        CASE 9:
            Exit program

        DEFAULT:
            Display invalid choice

    END SWITCH

UNTIL choice = 9
```

END
